OL,3,GNEWSABBC Scotland wins 8-year legal
OL,4,Achallenge over exclusion of reporter
OL,5,Afrom court
OL,6,
OL,7,FA BBC Scotland journalist who was
OL,8,Fexcluded from a court hearing has won a
OL,9,Fruling from Europe's highest human
OL,10,Frights court.
OL,12,FAberdeen-based Steven Duff had been
OL,13,Finvestigating an Aberdeenshire care
OL,14,Fhome where residents were reported to
OL,15,Fhave been mistreated in August 2018,
OL,16,Fwhen he was asked to leave the Sheriff
OL,17,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
