OL,3,GNEWSABBC Scotland wins 8-year legal
OL,4,Achallenge over exclusion of reporter
OL,5,Afrom court
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hearing was then conducted in
OL,8,Fprivate following a request from the
OL,9,Fcare home operator's legal
OL,10,Frepresentative, which the sheriff
OL,11,Fsubsequently granted.
OL,13,FThe European Court of Human Rights
OL,14,F(ECHR) sided with Duff, stating in
OL,15,FScotland the law recognises the
OL,16,Fprinciple of open justice, with court
OL,17,Fproceedings conducted in public except
OL,18,Fin the "rarest of circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
